      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] use DMAC as the synthesis solvent for Zn-btc-dmtrz systems → DMAC enabled crystalline structures 1 and 2 based on triazole-carboxylate shared paddle-wheel units, whereas other tested solvents gave unknown-phase powders"
