  "notable_quotes": [
    "Pyrazole and carboxylate groups have similar coordination geometries and can be interchanged to build new SBUs; a [Zn4O(O2C)2(NN)4] unit parallels the classic Zn4O(O2C)6 cluster.",
    "Two new porous Zn-MOFs, {Zn7(btc)4(dmtrz)2(H2O)5}n (1) and {[Zn6(btc)4(dmtrz)3]·3H3O·2H2O}n (2), were solvothermally synthesized from btc and dmtrz ligands.",
    "The bending configuration of [M2(trz)2] can provide coordination space for carboxylates, enabling construction of novel triazole-carboxylate shared paddle-wheel SBUs."
  ],
